[{"path":"README.md","fileType":"docs","lines":[{"lineNumber":1,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"# BrotherGym","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-14T11:01:05","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":2,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"BrotherGym helps gym trainers manage their students and allows them to plan and track the workouts of their students.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-14T11:01:05","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":3,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"It is optimised for CLI users so that frequent tasks can be done faster by typing in commands.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-14T11:01:05","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":4,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-14T11:01:05","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":5,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"## Existing AB3 Docs","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-14T11:01:05","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":6,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-14T11:01:05","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":7,"author":{"gitId":"kungfuxiongmao"},"content":"[![Java CI](https://github.com/AY2627S1-CS2103T-T11-4/tp/actions/workflows/gradle.yml/badge.svg?branch\u003dmaster)](https://github.com/AY2627S1-CS2103T-T11-4/tp/actions/workflows/gradle.yml) [![codecov](https://codecov.io/gh/AY2627S1-CS2103T-T11-4/tp/graph/badge.svg?token\u003dQ26D0A8JBU)](https://codecov.io/gh/AY2627S1-CS2103T-T11-4/tp)","lastModifiedDate":"2026-10-02T12:02:13","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":8,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-23T01:10:16","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":9,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"![Ui](docs/images/Ui.png)","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-23T01:10:16","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":10,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-23T01:10:16","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":11,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"* This is **a sample project for Software Engineering (SE) students**.\u003cbr\u003e","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-23T01:10:16","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":12,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"  Example usages:","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-23T01:10:16","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":13,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"  * as a starting point of a course project (as opposed to writing everything from scratch)","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-23T01:10:16","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":14,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"  * as a case study","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-23T01:10:16","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":15,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"* The project simulates an ongoing software project for a desktop application (called _AddressBook_) used for managing contact details.","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-23T01:10:16","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":16,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"  * It is **written in an object-oriented programming (OOP) style** and provides a **reasonably well-written** codebase of about 6 KLoC. It is **larger** than what students typically write in beginner-level software-engineering modules, without being overwhelming.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-07-15T02:00:52","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":17,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"  * It comes with a **reasonable level of user and developer documentation**.","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-23T01:10:16","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":18,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"* It is named `AddressBook Level 3` (`AB3` for short) because it was initially created as a part of a series of `AddressBook` projects (`Level 1`, `Level 2`, `Level 3` ...).","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-23T01:10:16","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":19,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"* For the detailed documentation of this project, see the **[Address Book Product Website](https://se-education.org/addressbook-level3)**.","lastModifiedDate":"2020-05-23T01:10:16","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":20,"author":{"gitId":"-"},"content":"* This project is a **part of the se-education.org** initiative. If you would like to c